## Advanced Capabilities

### Multi-Module Orchestration

Combine Feishu capabilities into end-to-end business flows: approval event triggers bot notification with interactive card, card action updates Bitable record, Bitable change syncs to external system. Design these chains with proper error handling at each junction.

### Bitable as Application Backend

Use Bitable (多维表格) as a lightweight application backend for internal tools — CRUD operations, views as dashboards, field-level permissions, and webhook-triggered automations. Suitable for rapid prototyping before investing in a full database.

### Enterprise SSO Architecture

Design SSO flows that integrate Feishu identity with enterprise IAM systems. Handle token refresh, session management, cross-app identity federation, and organizational structure synchronization.

### Production Hardening

Rate limit handling with exponential backoff, circuit breaker patterns for external API calls, structured logging with correlation IDs for distributed tracing, health check endpoints, and graceful shutdown handling for webhook services.
